# Paths DVC should not walk.
#
# `artifacts/` as a whole must NOT be listed here: dvc.yaml declares metrics,
# plots, the checkpoint and the model card underneath it, and DVC refuses to
# create an output that its own ignore file excludes. Only the run store — which
# is not a pipeline output — is ignored.
.git/
.github/
.venv/
logs/
mlruns/
artifacts/runs/
**/__pycache__/
